## 8. Editor ↔ server protocol

```
client → server  { type: "duplicate_nodes", ids, dx, dy, dz, count? }       // Alt-drag, Alt+J
client → server  { type: "mirror_nodes", ids, axis }
client → server  { type: "paste_nodes", nodes: [SceneNode], focus: { x, z }, parent: string | null }
client → server  { type: "remove_nodes", ids, cut?: true }                  // cut: same op, labelled "Cut"
server → client  unchanged (the copies' IDs come back in the next `scene`; the editor selects them, as it does after Cmd+G)
```

