### 05.2 — Alt-drag and Alt+J (done)

- **`gizmo.ts`:** `canCopy(part)` (body, x, z, y) and `dragOffset(origin, patches)`, the drag's world offset from the first box. Both tested.
- **Viewport:**
  - The drag records `copy` (Alt held on a move drag), from every pointer move and from Alt's own keydown and keyup, so toggling Alt without moving the pointer updates the preview. The release uses `e.altKey`, so Alt counts at release.
