  - Cmd+G's "select the new group when it arrives" became a general pending selection (`before` + `pick`). Copies use it too: the added nodes whose parent isn't also new are the copied roots.
  - The last Alt-drag offset is kept in a ref, reset when a scene opens. `Alt+J` (matched on `e.code === "KeyJ"`) duplicates the selection by it. With no offset or no selection, the info-label shows "Alt-drag a copy first" in yellow for 2.5 s.
